## Move MCP example scripts under resources/examples
================================================================================

Context: The standalone MCP client and benchmark scripts lived in a top-level
``examples/`` folder. They are developer tools rather than app code, so they
are moved under ``resources/examples/``. ``resources/`` is excluded from the
