================================================================================
## Allow multiple UC datasets (incl. metric views) per class
================================================================================

Context: Issue #221 — Ontology Studio only allowed one linked dataset per class,
and the picker excluded Unity Catalog metric views. Classes can now link several
tables/views/metric views as equal peers; runtime context (MCP, Graph Explorer,
Graph Chat) resolves all of them, with metric-aware SQL for metric views.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/ontology/ClassModel.py
   Add ``normalize_datasets`` / ``primary_dataset``; class field becomes
   ``datasets`` list with legacy singular ``dataset`` back-compat.
2. src/back/core/w3c/owl/OntologyParser.py / OntologyGenerator.py
   Parse/emit ``ontobricks:dataset`` as a JSON array; normalize legacy object.
3. src/back/objects/ontology/EntityImport.py
   Treat ``datasets`` as a domain-bound field on import.
4. src/back/core/databricks/uc/metric_sql.py
   Add ``build_metric_view_entity_sql`` (WHERE key + MEASURE/GROUP BY + LIMIT).
5. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/node/NodeDatasetService.py
   New service resolving N datasets (table/view SELECT * or metric-view SQL).
6. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/node/NodeContextService.py
   Emit ``datasets`` plus singular ``dataset`` (first) for one-release back-compat.
7. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-shared-panels.js
   Multi-item Datasets Links panel; picker badges for TABLE/VIEW/METRIC_VIEW;
   dimension-preferring key columns for metric views.
8. src/front/static/query/js/query-*.js + ontology-map.js
   Graph Explorer/Chat loaders, details, preview, and badges handle ``datasets[]``.
9. src/api/routers/{digitaltwin,domains,internal/dtwin}.py
   REST models/payloads expose ``datasets`` (keep singular ``dataset``).
10. src/mcp-server/server/{formatting,session,tools}.py + agents formatting
    MCP/Graph Chat inventory and context text list all linked datasets.
11. docs/advanced_features.md, docs/user-guide.md
    Document multi-dataset + metric-view linking.
12. tests (units for ClassModel, OWL round-trip, metric SQL, front contracts, API)

